{{also|Russel}}
==German==

===Etymology===
With irregular shortening of the stem vowel from {{inh|de|gmh|rüezel}}, from {{inh|de|goh|*ruozil}}, derived from the verb {{cog|goh|ruozan||to grub, root}}, from {{der|de|gem-pro|*wrōtaną}}, whence also {{cog|nl|wroeten||to grub}} and {{cog|en|root}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈʁʏsəl/|[ˈʁʏsəl]|[ˈʁʏsl̩]|lang=de}}

===Noun===
{{de-noun|m|Rüssels|Rüssel|Rüsselchen}}

# [[pig]]'s [[snout]]
# [[proboscis]]; [[trunk]] {{gloss|prolonged nose of certain mammals, notably elephants}}
# [[proboscis]] {{gloss|similar organ in certain insects, etc.}}
# {{lb|de|informal|possibly|_|offensive}} [[beak]] {{gloss|human nose, especially a large one}}

